    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7605" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cervīcŭla</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		dim.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A small neck</i>, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 3, 19, § 49</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">App. Flor. p. 348</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">contracta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 11, 3, 180</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In mechanics, <i>the neck of a hydraulic
				machine</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 10, 8, 2</span></i>.</div>
